{"sha": "99c71211ed3c220f1a3e2a6f1f27863039e14da3b099ccf5d1a8af5e90bdfaaa", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:rc-rl-circuits} 章 --- RC 与 RL 电路}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:1}", "$q = Cu = 4.7\\times10^{-4} \\times 12 \\approx \\qty{5.6}{mC}$;", "$u = q/C = 2.0\\times10^{-3}/10^{-4} = \\qty{20}{V}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:2}", "\\qty{47}{pF}：收音机调谐器；\\qty{2200}{\\micro F}：平滑用；\\qty{10}{F}：", "超级电容器。$E = \\tfrac12 \\times 10 \\times 2.7^2 \\approx \\qty{36}{J}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:3}", "$i = C\\,\\Delta u/\\Delta t = 2.2\\times10^{-4} \\times 5.0/0.010 =", "\\qty{0.11}{A}$。然后 $i = C\\,du/dt = 0$：带电电容器相当于", "断开的电路 --- 无稳定电流。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:4}", "$RC = 10^4 \\times 10^{-4} = \\qty{1.0}{s}$;", "$L/R = 0.10/50 = \\qty{2.0}{ms}$. $\\unit{\\ohm}\\,\\unit{F} =", "(\\unit{V/A})(\\unit{C/V}) = \\unit{C/A} = \\unit{s}$;", "$\\unit{H}/\\unit{\\ohm} = (\\unit{V.s/A})/(\\unit{V/A}) = \\unit{s}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:5}", "$3.8/6.0 = 0.63$，故 $\\tau = \\qty{2.0}{s}$；$95\\%$ 对应 $3\\tau =", "\\qty{6.0}{s}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:6}", "$\\tau = 4700 \\times 2.2\\times10^{-4} \\approx \\qty{1.0}{s}$;", "$u(\\tau) = 0.63 \\times 9.0 = \\qty{5.7}{V}$;", "$u(3\\tau) = 0.95 \\times 9.0 = \\qty{8.6}{V}$;", "$I_0 = \\mathcal{E}/R = 9.0/4700 \\approx \\qty{1.9}{mA}$（电容器未充电时：", "$\\mathcal{E}$ 全部加在 $R$ 两端）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:7}", "$du/dt = (\\mathcal{E}/RC)e^{-t/RC}$，故 $RC\\,du/dt + u =", "\\mathcal{E}e^{-t/RC} + \\mathcal{E}(1 - e^{-t/RC}) = \\mathcal{E}$.", "$u(0) = 0$：电容器开始时不带电；$u \\to \\mathcal{E}$：", "充满电，电流已停止。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:8}", "$\\tau = 4.7\\times10^{4} \\times 10^{-4} = \\qty{4.7}{s}$;", "$u(\\tau) = 12\\,e^{-1} \\approx \\qty{4.4}{V}$；\\qty{0.60}{V} 为 $5\\%$，", "在 $3\\tau \\approx \\qty{14}{s}$ 时达到。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:9}", "$u = L\\,\\Delta i/\\Delta t = 0.50 \\times 2.0/0.040 = \\qty{25}{V}$.", "闭合时，$i$ 按电路本身的快慢增长，$di/dt$ 较小；断开时", "\\emph{迫使} $i$ 几乎瞬间降为零，$di/dt$ 极大，$u$", "达到足以产生火花的数值。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:10}", "$di/dt = (\\mathcal{E}/L)e^{-Rt/L}$，故 $L\\,di/dt + Ri =", "\\mathcal{E}e^{-Rt/L} + \\mathcal{E}(1 - e^{-Rt/L}) = \\mathcal{E}$.", "$i(\\tau) = 0.63 \\times 2.0 = \\qty{1.3}{A}$;", "$i(3\\tau) = 0.95 \\times 2.0 = \\qty{1.9}{A}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:11}", "$u'(t) = (\\mathcal{E}/\\tau)e^{-t/\\tau}$，故 $u'(0) = \\mathcal{E}/\\tau$：", "切线 $u = (\\mathcal{E}/\\tau)\\,t$ 到达 $\\mathcal{E}$ 的时刻为", "$t = \\tau$. $C = \\tau/R = 0.50/2000 = \\qty{250}{\\micro F}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:12}", "超级电容器 $\\tfrac12 \\times 3000 \\times 2.7^2 \\approx \\qty{1.1e4}{J}$；", "闪光灯 $\\tfrac12 \\times 8.0\\times10^{-4} \\times 300^2 = \\qty{36}{J}$；", "线圈 $\\tfrac12 \\times 0.010 \\times 10^2 = \\qty{0.50}{J}$。电池", "（$\\qty{1.3e4}{J}$）$>$ 超级电容器 $\\gg$ 闪光灯 $\\gg$ 线圈 --- 但三者", "都能在毫秒内释放能量：关心的是功率，而非能量。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:13}", "$\\tau = \\qty{5.0}{s}$，故 $R = \\tau/C = 5.0/10^{-4} = \\qty{50}{k\\ohm}$。", "$1 - e^{-t/\\tau} = 0.50$ 得 $e^{-t/\\tau} = 0.50$，$t = \\tau\\ln 2", "\\approx 0.69\\,\\tau = \\qty{3.5}{s}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:14}", "$\\Delta u = i\\,\\Delta t/C = 0.50 \\times 0.010/2.2\\times10^{-3} \\approx", "\\qty{2.3}{V}$。需满足 $C \\geq i\\,\\Delta t/\\Delta u =", "5.0\\times10^{-3}/0.50 = \\qty{10}{mF}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:rc-rl-circuits:15}", "$u \\approx L\\,\\Delta i/\\Delta t = 0.80 \\times 2.0/10^{-3} =", "\\qty{1.6}{kV}$; $E_L = \\tfrac12 \\times 0.80 \\times 2.0^2 =", "\\qty{1.6}{J}$。缓慢断开时，$di/dt$ 保持较小，$u$ 仅为几伏：", "不会产生火花。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:rc-rl-circuits:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $q = CU_0 = 8.0\\times10^{-4} \\times 300 = \\qty{0.24}{C}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $N = 0.24/1.60\\times10^{-19} = \\num{1.5e18}$.", "", "\\textbf{3.} $E_C = \\tfrac12 \\times 8.0\\times10^{-4} \\times 300^2 =", "\\qty{36}{J}$.", "", "\\textbf{4.} $\\num{1.3e4}/36 \\approx 360$ 倍。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 电池储存的能量很多，但释放缓慢；电容器", "把不多的能量转化为极大的\\emph{功率}。", ""]}